{"page":25,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:164","surah":2,"ayah":164,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ فِى خَلْقِ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَٱخْتِلَـٰفِ ٱلَّيْلِ وَٱلنَّهَارِ وَٱلْفُلْكِ ٱلَّتِى تَجْرِى فِى ٱلْبَحْرِ بِمَا يَنفَعُ ٱلنَّاسَ وَمَآ أَنزَلَ ٱللَّهُ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مِن مَّآءٍ فَأَحْيَا بِهِ ٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ مَوْتِهَا وَبَثَّ فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ دَآبَّةٍ وَتَصْرِيفِ ٱلرِّيَـٰحِ وَٱلسَّحَابِ ٱلْمُسَخَّرِ بَيْنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يَعْقِلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In the creation of the heavens and earth; in the alternation of night and day; in the ships that sail the seas with goods for people; in the water which God sends down from the sky to give life to the earth when it has been barren, scattering all kinds of creatures over it; in the changing of the winds and clouds that run their appointed courses between the sky and earth: there are signs in all these for those who use their minds.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":3,"ar":"خَلْقِ","en_gloss":"(the) creation","transliteration":"khalqi","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱخْتِلَـٰفِ","en_gloss":"and alternation","transliteration":"wa-ikh'tilāfi","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلَّيْلِ","en_gloss":"of the night","transliteration":"al-layli","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","en_gloss":"and the day","transliteration":"wal-nahāri","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَٱلْفُلْكِ","en_gloss":"and the ships","transliteration":"wal-ful'ki","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى","en_gloss":"which","transliteration":"allatī","verse_key":"2:164"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تَجْرِى","en_gloss":"sail","translite